(text "3.3 V bus: straight to the GPIO, no level shifting." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 156.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "e7f64dc3-c0e7-5548-921b-ed9a30c30b03"))
(text "NOTES" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 173.355 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid "d33376cc-dd70-5616-820c-b034e3f43d52"))
(text "1. J1: scale Li-ion 1S battery (≤ 4.2 V). J2: panel switch ≥ 2 A. U2: TPS63020 module with the output jumper on 3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "2916fcd8-a0aa-5931-918a-5560d997117f"))
(text "2. J4/J5: 5 V 0.16 A fan: red → 1 (+), black → 2 (−); yellow (tachometer) and blue (PWM) insulated." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "6eec8a9a-0000-5e48-ae2f-1bf932c58227"))
(text "3. J6: display connector (SL, DA, GND); the display VCC is not connected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "4fd56d99-a5b7-59bc-97f5-bc3d27c7268c"))
(text "4. U1 in a 2 × 1x9 female socket, rows 15.24 mm apart; U2 on 4 pins at its corners. Q1/Q2 2N2222 E-B-C." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "40cb03a7-194d-54e4-b451-edc4936a3599"))
(text "5. Diodes: band = cathode (square pad). Electrolytics: long lead to +." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 187.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "24884d4d-1061-5357-a6bf-5b83e3fe2a13"))
(text "6. PCB: tracks at 0/45/90°; power 1.0 mm, 3V3 and fans 0.8 mm, signal 0.3 mm; GND on both layers." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "6f78c517-bc59-5e40-b006-8c55f6c05ba5"))
(text "7. First power-up without U1 (with U2): measure 3.3 V between the 3V3 and GND pins of the U1 socket." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "0066962f-c76e-5bc4-ac9c-9e6ed77a5b39"))
